## Exercise media

The MIT licence above covers the dataset structure and instruction text only. It
does not cover the exercise media served from `images/` and `videos/`, which is:

```
© Gym visual — https://gymvisual.com/
```

The upstream repository includes that media with Gym visual's written
permission, and states that cloning it grants no licence to the media — the
permission does not transfer. Forge therefore has no licence to it. This app
bundles none of it: `src/data/exercises.json` carries only file names, and the
running app loads the images over the network from a CDN copy of the upstream
repository. Its use is governed by Gym visual's terms and conditions
(https://gymvisual.com/content/3-terms-and-conditions-of-use), and the
attribution above is retained wherever it is shown. Anyone deploying Forge is
responsible for their own use of the media; building with
`VITE_EXERCISE_MEDIA=off` produces an instance that never requests it.

